@doc """
    secondPiolaKirchhoffStress!(mp, S::Istensor)

Compute the symmetric second Piola-Kirchhoff stress ``S`` into `S`.

``S`` is unaffected by a rigid rotation of the deformation, which makes it the convenient
measure for a material-frame formulation.
"""
function secondPiolaKirchhoffStress! end

